[1.2686, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.402, "o", "control: ping then ARP, no injection: the injector must not disturb the bench\r\n"]
[19.1055, "o", "  PASS rtl   TB model_errors=0 mdio_frames=50 mdio_x=0 tx_frames=2 uart_framing=0 lines=2 | rx=2 fe=0 ce=0 aq=1 ar=1 eq=1 er=1\r\ner_in_ip_header: RX_ER on data nibble 60 of the ping (IP destination, first byte): the frame ends there, 30 bytes, below 64: fe; the tail starts with nibble C and is skipped\r\n"]
[19.1056, "o", "  PASS rtl   TB model_errors=0 mdio_frames=50 mdio_x=0 tx_frames=1 uart_framing=0 lines=2 | rx=2 fe=1 ce=0 aq=1 ar=1 eq=0 er=0\r\ner_in_preamble: RX_ER on preamble nibble 5 of the ping: R_PRE clears r_5, the next 5s set it again, the SFD starts the frame: answered as if no error (802.3 22.2.2.5 would drop it)\r\n"]
[19.1057, "o", "  PASS rtl   TB model_errors=0 mdio_frames=50 mdio_x=0 tx_frames=2 uart_framing=0 lines=2 | rx=2 fe=0 ce=0 aq=1 ar=1 eq=1 er=1\r\n"]
[19.1057, "o", "er_then_false_sfd: RX_ER on data nibble 67 of a frame whose payload has 55 D5 next: the frame ends (34 bytes: fe), the tail 5 5 5 D starts a second frame (84 bytes, FCS of the whole: fe). One errored frame counts rx 2, fe 2. Then the ARP is answered\r\n"]
[19.1192, "o", "  PASS rtl   TB model_errors=0 mdio_frames=50 mdio_x=0 tx_frames=1 uart_framing=0 lines=2 | rx=3 fe=2 ce=0 aq=1 ar=1 eq=0 er=0\r\nfalse_carrier: four nibbles of false carrier (DV 0, ER 1, RXD E) 40 nibbles after the ping: R_PRE sees E, goes to R_SKIP until the falling sample drops: no counter, both answered\r\n"]
[19.1193, "o", "  PASS rtl   TB model_errors=0 mdio_frames=50 mdio_x=0 tx_frames=2 uart_framing=0 lines=2 | rx=2 fe=0 ce=0 aq=1 ar=1 eq=1 er=1\r\n"]
[19.1196, "o", "5/5 checks as pre-registered; logs in /tmp/e3rxer/\r\n"]
